```python
def count_vowels(text):
    count = 0
    for char in text.lower():
        if char in 'aeiou':
            count += 1
    return count

print(count_vowels('Hello World'))  # 3
```

It lowercases the text so capital vowels count too, then adds 1 for each vowel it finds.

